Cell["What if you sum the last three terms instead of two?", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9790319029459867`*^9, 
  3.979031903726158*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"70a81d5c-cc49-445e-a012-\
fe3298a3447a"],

